  "id": "weighting",
  "term": "weighting",
  "definition": "Weighting is the process of giving different degrees of influence to prior beliefs and new evidence when forming or updating a judgment. In this account, weighting changes with factors such as attention, mental effort, learned reliability, and perceived uncertainty in the environment.",
